OL,7,G1100 The Gunfighter
OL,8,     F(1950) Western. Gregory Peck stars
OL,9,     Fas Jimmy Ringo, an ageing
OL,10,     Fgunslinger searching for his
OL,11,     Festranged wife and son. But he's
OL,12,     Fconstantly impeded by the young
OL,13,     Fbucks who are out to gun him down.
OL,14,G1245 Faintheart
OL,15,     F(2008) Comedy with Eddie Marsan
OL,16,     Fand Jessica Hynes. A husband who's
OL,17,     Fobsessed with Viking re-enactments
OL,18,     Fmust decide whether his heart lies
OL,19,     Fwith his hobby or winning back his
OL,20,     Festranged wife.
